264	    /**
265	     * Find an existing owner that this (not yet persisted) owner soft-matches: one sharing its last
266	     * name (ignoring case) and postcode but carrying a different telephone, so it is not a hard
267	     * identity-key duplicate. Returns the matching owner's id (the lowest when several match), or
268	     * {@code null} when the owner has no postcode or nothing matches.
